    {
      "@type": "dcat:Dataset",
      "title": "Continuum of Care (CoC) Homeless Populations and Subpopulations Reports",
      "description": "This report displays the data communities reported to HUD about the nature of and amount of persons who are homeless as part of HUD's Point-in-Time (PIT) Count.  This data is self-reported by communities to HUD as part of its competitive Continuum of Care application process.  The website allows users to select PIT data from 2005 to present.  Users can use filter by CoC, states, or the entire nation.",
