      "@type": "dcat:Dataset",
      "title": "Contract Renewal Information - All Contracts",
      "description": "Multifamily Portfolio datasets (section 8 contracts) - The information has been compiled from multiple data sources within FHA or its contractors.\nHUD oversees more than 22,000 privately owned multifamily properties, and more than 1.4 million assisted housing units.  These homes were originally financed with FHA-insured or Direct Loans and many are supported with Section 8 or other rental assistance contracts.  Our existing stock of affordable rental housing is a critical resource for seniors and families who otherwise would not have access to safe, decent places to call home.",
