    {
      "@type": "dcat:Dataset",
      "title": "Deteriorated Paint Index by State",
      "description": "The Deteriorated Paint Index (DPI) data predicts areas at-risk of containing several pre-1980 households with large areas of deteriorated paint, a significant and common predictor of lead dust, at the State level. Funding for remediation and abatement is limited. To adequately target households eligible for home remediation and associated intervention efforts, local healthy homes and environmental health program administrators must identify neighborhoods that are the most \u201cat risk\u201d of residential lead exposure where deteriorated paint is the primary source. To address this need, the DPI uses household-level data to predict a household\u2019s risk of deteriorated paint.",
