    {
      "@type": "dcat:Dataset",
      "title": "Fair Housing Assistance Program (FHAP) Grantees",
      "description": "This dataset denotes the locations and pertinent information for Fair Housing Assistance Program (FHAP) grantees. If such agencies are determined by FHEO to enforce state or local fair housing laws that are substantially equivalent to the federal Fair Housing Act, they can receive financial and operational assistance from FHEO to enforce such laws. FHAP agencies receive funding from HUD to support their efforts. Payments are made once a year after the end of the period of performance for that agency.",
