      "@type": "dcat:Dataset",
      "title": "Fair Housing Initiatives Program (FHIP) Grantees",
      "description": "This dataset denotes the locations and pertinent information for Fair Housing Initiatives Program (FHIP) grantees. The Fair Housing Initiatives Program (FHIP) is a competitive grant program established by the Housing and Community Development Act of 1987 (42 U.S.C. 3616) which allows for grants to private non-profit organizations to assist with issues of housing discrimination.",
