    {
      "@type": "dcat:Dataset",
      "title": "Property Owners and Managers Survey - Single Family Microdata",
      "description": "The Property Owners and Managers Survey (POMS) wasa one-time survey designed to learn more about rental housing and the providers of rental housing. The purpose of the survey was to gain a better understanding of the property owners and managers on whom the nation depends to provide affordable rental housing, and of what motivates and shapes their rental and maintenance policies. This dataset contains the single family macrodata.",
