      "@type": "dcat:Dataset",
      "title": "School Proficiency Index",
      "description": "This dataset denotes values of the School Proficiency Index. The index illustrates school-level data to describe neighborhoods relative to nearby school performance. Specifically, the data is on the performance of 4th grade students on state exams to describe which neighborhoods have high-performing elementary schools nearby and which are near lower performing elementary schools.",
