      "description": "This feature service denotes the locations of HUD assisted Multi-Family properties that primarily serve disabled residents. In addition, each property illustrated through this service has at least one active Service Coordinator contract or grant, Section 8 New Construction contract, Section 811 Project Assistance Contracts (PAC) contract, or Section 811 Project Rental Assistance Contract (PRAC).",
