    {
      "@type": "dcat:Dataset",
      "title": "Single Family Housing Counseling Agencies",
      "description": "This service provides the locations and pertinent information for HUD Single Family Housing Counseling Agency (HCA) resources. HCA's are trained and approved to provide tools to current and prospective homeowners and renters so that they can make responsible choices to address their housing needs in light of their financial situations. Location data for HUD-related properties and facilities are derived from HUD's enterprise geocoding service.",
